- Initial package of the everything, filesystem, memory and
  sequential-thinking servers from release 2.4.0
- Replace the fast-uri 3.1.8 sources inlined in the MCP SDK with
  those of release 3.1.9 (replace-fast-uri.mjs):
  * CVE-2026-110306: URI scheme spoofing via percent-encoded
    scheme decoding (bsc#1286297)
  * CVE-2026-110180: host confusion via unchecked WHATWG host
    canonicalization (bsc#1286297)
  * CVE-2026-110095: improper path equivalence in relative
    reference normalization (bsc#1286297)
  * CVE-2026-110725: scheme injection via an unescaped
    first-segment colon in suffix references (bsc#1286297)
- mcp-server-memory: keep the graph under XDG_DATA_HOME by
  default, the location next to the server code is not writable

